# 🏛️ Prasad Consultancy
### Modern Tax Advisory, Financial Compliance & GST Web Platform

[![Live Platform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Live_App-prasad--consultancy.onrender.com-D97706?style=for-the-badge&logo=render&logoColor=white)](https://prasad-consultancy.onrender.com)
[![Python Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.12%2B-121826?style=for-the-badge&logo=python&logoColor=white)](https://python.org)
[![Django Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/Django-5.2.8-092E20?style=for-the-badge&logo=django&logoColor=white)](https://djangoproject.com)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-FBBF24?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE)

*A production-ready web platform for **Prasad Consultancy** (Pimpri, Pune) featuring dynamic tax regime estimators, real-time GST calculators, lead generation workflows, and a custom Charcoal & Bronze Gold corporate design system.*

[Explore Live Web App 🚀](https://prasad-consultancy.onrender.com) • [Report Issue 🐛](https://github.com/D-Prasad19/tax_consultant_site/issues)

</div>

---

## ⚡ Core Highlights

<table>
  <tr>
    <td width="50%">
      <h3>🧮 Real-Time GST Engine</h3>
      <p>Supports both <b>GST Exclusive</b> and <b>GST Inclusive</b> calculations. Instantly computes CGST, SGST, Total Tax liability, and Net Payable amounts.</p>
    </td>
    <td width="50%">
      <h3>📊 Income Tax Regime Estimator</h3>
      <p>Evaluates gross income against eligible deductions (80C, 80D, HRA) and generates visual savings badges for the <b>Old vs. New Tax Regimes</b>.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td width="50%">
      <h3>📬 Validated Lead Capture</h3>
      <p>Contact form equipped with custom regex 10-digit Indian phone validation, message sanitization, and direct persistence in Django Admin.</p>
    </td>
    <td width="50%">
      <h3>🎨 Charcoal & Bronze Gold UI</h3>
      <p>Built with a luxury corporate palette (<code>#121826</code> Charcoal base + <code>#D97706</code> Bronze Gold accents) and responsive mobile drawers.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

